<title>AUSTRALIA: Power Pacific put into administration. [CORRECTED 00:27 18/07]</title>
<headline>Power Pacific put into administration. [CORRECTED 00:27 18/07]</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company name from Pacific Power)</p>
<p>Gas-fired power hopeful Power Pacific Ltd had been placed into administration and the company's shares would continue to be suspended, the administrator said on Friday.</p>
<p>Power Pacific shares last traded on July 9, closing down 0.7 of a cent at 4.5 cents before it was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement over a proposed joint venture in Vietnam.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
